You most probably have an MTU mismatch - Ethernet only supports MTUs up
to 1500, FDDI is usually set higher. Try setting the MTU on the DEC Machine
to 1500. I heard it also helps to turn off path mtu discovery on the 
Solaris clients, unfortunately I don't know how to do that off hand - 
probably something with ndd and /dev/ip.

