Try follows:

    # scu scan edt bus 0
    # scu show edt bus 0         <<- make sure to see the CD-ROM entry
    # cd /dev
    # rm rrz5* rz5*
    # ./MAKEDEV rz5
    # mount -r /dev/rz5c /mnt        << -- try to mount CD-ROM again

    If still fails, shutdown down the system and type "show device" on the
