>Installation guide is not be included for V4.0D Upgrade Kit.
>I have made many installations before, but can someone advise me.
>
>Please give me short command summary to start the upgrade V4.0B -> V4.0D.
>I have ADVFS domains.
>
>For example: shutdown now, umount, verify, bcheckrc .... installupdate .????

1. BACK UP your system, in case anything goes wrong ;
2. Shut down, and update your firmware if necessary ;
3. Boot to single user mode ;
4. Run bcheckrc ;
5. Run installupdate ;
6. Note any warnings about layered products needing to be updated,
   and install whatever updates you've got.

As far as I'm aware, the procedure is the same for UFS as it is for
ADVFS.

I did this on an 800 5/333 and it took me under an hour.

Chris
