Charles M Richmond <cmr@iisc.com> writes:
> > > Yes, the page has ALT's.  However, all the links to pfeiffer.htm,
> > > palmer.htm, and pressrel.htm are in client side imagemaps.  The only
> > > HREF in the entire document that isn't a client side imagemap or
> > > javascript is the link to "Legal".  So while the page may look ok
> > > without images, it is impossible to navigate further with a browser
> > > that doesn't support client side imagemaps.  ALT does not solve that
> > > problem in any way.
> 
