Try this:

in /usr/var/X11/Xserver.conf add this line at the end of the 
file:


! you specify command line arguments here
args <
        -pn -screen 1280 -vsync 70
>
~

then stop and restart the window manager like this:
#/sbin/init.d/xlogin stop
<Enter>
relogin
#/sbin/init.d/xlogin start

Good luck,
