> I'm still very new to Unix and have a problem of transfering data from a
> DAT tape to a Unix box with a DLT tape drive.  I do have a Spare Unix box
> with a DAT drive and I plan to copy the data onto it.  I can get them to
> talk together using TCP/IP, well I can ping each machine from the other.  I
> know this is a ridiculously basic question but how do you copy files from
> one machine to the other over a network.
> 
